    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase 4 tests for <ref refid="logger_8cpp" kindref="compound">logger.cpp</ref> and <ref refid="tracing_8cpp" kindref="compound">tracing.cpp</ref> error contracts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Coverage targets (Phase 4 gate):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Logger::init() emit structured LOG_INITIALIZATION_FAILED on sink failure</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Logger error codes in range 9020-9029</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Tracer::initialize() fail-open behavior (returns false, does not throw)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Tracer error codes in range 9030-9039</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ErrorContext categorisation for observability codes </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
